    "motion_text": "Motion to NOT APPROVE Ordinance 8521 amending the designated boundary to include all of Block 13 for the property at 1236 Canyon Blvd. , City of Boulder, Colorado, a landmark under Chapter 9-11, “Historic Preservation,” B.R.C. 1981; but to direct Planning and Development Services staff to prioritize beginning an effort to explore designating a larger Civic Area historic district in 2023. Furthermore, council directs staff to ensure that the Landmarks Board and Parks & Recreation Advisory Board are both appropriately engaged in the park design process and that the bandshell is included in the design and continues to be a centerpiece in Central Park.",
